1
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,925
This big boy is so lovable.

2
00:00:38,925 --> 00:00:39,500
This big boy.

3
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,380
No wonder he's so tall.

4
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:43,130
Who did he get it from?

5
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:45,980
Such a big guy.

6
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:51,280
Y'know?

7
00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,400
Let me try.

8
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:57,790
Put your hands up. What hands?

9
00:00:58,390 --> 00:00:59,090
I don't have hands.

10
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:00,840
I've used my arms since I was little.

11
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,365
Honestly, I can't win this one.

12
00:01:02,365 --> 00:01:03,265
And none of you will win either.

13
00:01:03,265 --> 00:01:04,615
I won't wear this sleeping bag anymore.

14
00:01:04,615 --> 00:01:06,265
I'll guard here and see who gets past me.

15
00:01:06,265 --> 00:01:08,090
I just love watching He fall in love.

16
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:10,340
I just love watching this kind of stuff.

17
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,620
What exactly are you saying OK to?

18
00:01:15,770 --> 00:01:17,420
Who let you change my destination?

19
00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:18,120
I'm the big baby.

20
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:19,045
Shoot me if you have the guts.

21
00:01:19,045 --> 00:01:21,220
What the hell is this gun for?

22
00:01:21,820 --> 00:01:22,670
What use are you?

23
00:01:22,670 --> 00:01:23,770
You're completely useless.

24
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:26,220
Always acting tough and bullying us.

25
00:01:26,320 --> 00:01:29,645
He just says whatever works for him.

26
00:01:29,645 --> 00:01:30,420
You can get out now.

27
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:30,870
Friend.

28
00:01:32,570 --> 00:01:33,320
Wifey.

29
00:01:38,190 --> 00:01:39,690
Where are your things?

30
00:01:41,390 --> 00:01:42,665
Should I go lead the way?

31
00:01:42,665 --> 00:01:43,190
Guys.

32
00:01:43,190 --> 00:01:43,965
Of course.

33
00:01:43,965 --> 00:01:45,040
You gotta lead.

34
00:01:46,340 --> 00:01:47,115
Don't disappear on me.

35
00:01:47,115 --> 00:01:47,490
Nobody's here.

36
00:01:47,490 --> 00:01:48,140
Let's keep moving forward.

37
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:50,240
Let me check if there's any danger.

38
00:01:50,240 --> 00:01:51,115
OK, turn off the lights.

39
00:01:51,115 --> 00:01:51,440
Come on.

40
00:01:53,290 --> 00:01:54,290
Is something moving?

41
00:01:54,840 --> 00:01:55,065
It's fine.

42
00:01:55,065 --> 00:01:55,440
Holy crap.

43
00:01:57,190 --> 00:01:57,990
Now listen to me.

44
00:01:57,990 --> 00:01:58,615
Here's the situation.

45
00:01:58,615 --> 00:01:59,490
I'm at the very front.

46
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:00,590
So you guys just follow me.

47
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:01,765
Just keep moving forward, don't worry.

48
00:02:01,765 --> 00:02:02,890
Because I'm still in front of you.

49
00:02:04,340 --> 00:02:04,790
It's fine.

50
00:02:04,790 --> 00:02:05,440
It's fine.

51
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,590
Come on, come on.

52
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:08,190
It's fine.

53
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:09,590
It's fine, it's fine.

54
00:02:10,940 --> 00:02:13,090
The God of Destiny always favors me.

55
00:02:13,090 --> 00:02:14,440
I've unlocked it, fam.

56
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,790
We can help you guys.

57
00:02:15,790 --> 00:02:16,165
For example.

58
00:02:16,165 --> 00:02:16,840
I'll carry it on my back.

59
00:02:17,140 --> 00:02:17,565
Right?

60
00:02:17,565 --> 00:02:18,365
I'll do squats.

61
00:02:18,365 --> 00:02:19,815
Thirteen, fourteen.

62
00:02:19,815 --> 00:02:20,090
Hey.

63
00:02:20,090 --> 00:02:22,440
It's fine, it's fine, it's fine.

64
00:02:22,440 --> 00:02:22,990
Let's go, go.

65
00:02:22,990 --> 00:02:23,440
Take it slow.

66
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:23,990
Take it slow.

67
00:02:24,890 --> 00:02:26,940
We'll just look for the shoes.

68
00:02:27,290 --> 00:02:27,690
Right.

69
00:02:28,090 --> 00:02:28,990
Lord Egg.

70
00:02:33,190 --> 00:02:36,340
I'm so eager to protect the princess...

71
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:39,110
I'd die for her anytime, anywhere.

72
00:02:40,010 --> 00:02:40,785
It's okay, it's okay.

73
00:02:40,785 --> 00:02:41,610
Lean on me.

74
00:02:44,760 --> 00:02:45,085
Ah.

75
00:02:45,085 --> 00:02:46,960
I really am protecting you!

76
00:02:47,210 --> 00:02:48,035
You protected me.

77
00:02:48,035 --> 00:02:48,360
Bro.

78
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:48,910
Can't bring him.

79
00:02:48,910 --> 00:02:49,285
Can't bring you.

80
00:02:49,285 --> 00:02:49,885
Take one.

81
00:02:49,885 --> 00:02:50,210
Oh.

82
00:02:50,310 --> 00:02:51,160
I brought it for you.

83
00:02:51,760 --> 00:02:52,610
Thanks, bro.

84
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:55,410
I brought you the smelly stick. Come on.

85
00:02:55,410 --> 00:02:56,560
Take this, take this, take this.

86
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:57,635
Wait, you protected me.

87
00:02:57,635 --> 00:02:58,010
Bro.

88
00:02:58,060 --> 00:02:59,460
I-I-I-I mean...

89
00:02:59,560 --> 00:02:59,935
Yeah.

90
00:02:59,935 --> 00:03:01,110
I'm a blade.

91
00:03:01,110 --> 00:03:02,810
A blade doesn't need a brain.

92
00:03:02,810 --> 00:03:05,010
A blade just needs to be sharp.

93
00:03:05,110 --> 00:03:05,710
First of all,

94
00:03:05,860 --> 00:03:07,885
you're sure the body is under the bed.

95
00:03:07,885 --> 00:03:08,160
Okay.

96
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,285
Then if I were feeling guilty,

97
00:03:09,285 --> 00:03:10,760
would I invite four people to my room

98
00:03:10,860 --> 00:03:12,010
to sit on top of the dead body?

99
00:03:12,010 --> 00:03:13,073
Am I that bold

100
00:03:13,073 --> 00:03:14,310
when I have a guilty conscience?

101
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:15,010
So right now, as I see it,

102
00:03:15,010 --> 00:03:16,160
I'm quite suspicious of you.

103
00:03:16,410 --> 00:03:17,910
You definitely won't find someone who

104
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:18,865
has both.

105
00:03:18,865 --> 00:03:20,990
Nor will you find anyone who has neither.

106
00:03:20,990 --> 00:03:24,040
Because to me, your motives are average.

107
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:26,390
That sticker was put back on.

108
00:03:26,390 --> 00:03:27,765
Who told you it was put back on?

109
00:03:27,765 --> 00:03:28,915
Because two layers are stuck together.

110
00:03:28,915 --> 00:03:30,490
How do you know when it was stuck on?

111
00:03:30,490 --> 00:03:31,615
It's just a guess.

112
00:03:31,615 --> 00:03:32,890
What's the basis for your guess?

113
00:03:32,890 --> 00:03:34,690
Why is it that you haven't been into

114
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:34,965
the mortuary?

115
00:03:34,965 --> 00:03:37,690
How do you prove you've never been there?

116
00:03:37,690 --> 00:03:39,365
I must take responsibility for my words.

117
00:03:39,365 --> 00:03:39,840
It's fine.

118
00:03:39,940 --> 00:03:41,690
I don't buckle under pressure.

119
00:03:42,090 --> 00:03:42,740
Got it?

120
00:03:42,790 --> 00:03:44,440
Pressure me all you want.
